        "note": "The lease you signed",
        "author": "Agence des Lilas",
        "text": "LEASE AGREEMENT\n\nBetween Agence des Lilas, on behalf of the owner, and the tenant.\n\nPremises: two-room flat, 12 rue des Lilas, Paris 20e, third floor, with cellar.\n\nTerm: three years from 1 September 2024, renewable.\n\nRent: €1,450 per month, charges included, payable on the 5th of each month.\n\nClause 8.2 · Notice: the tenant may terminate with one month's notice, the property being in a high-demand area.\n\nDeposit: one month's rent, returned within one month of departure.\n\nSigned in Paris on 28 August 2024."
      },
      {
        "label": "Renewal",
        "at": "-12 10:20",
        "note": "Rent +1.8%, in line with the index",
        "author": "Marta Ribeiro",
        "text": "LEASE AGREEMENT · RENEWAL\n\nPremises: two-room flat, 12 rue des Lilas, Paris 20e.\n\nRent: €1,480 per month from 1 November 2026, an increase of 1.8% in line with the rent reference index.\n\nClause 8.2 · Notice: one month.\n\nAll other terms unchanged.\n\nAgence des Lilas, 12 October 2026."
      },
