        "text": "LEASE AGREEMENT · VERSION 3\n\nPremises: two-room flat, 12 rue des Lilas, Paris 20e.\n\nRent: €1,480 per month from 1 November 2026.\n\nClause 8.2 · Notice: the tenant may terminate with three months' notice.\n\nAll other terms unchanged from the renewal of 12 October 2026.\n\nAgence des Lilas, 23 October 2026."
      }
